WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.129
"What's wrong, Blinx?" Hob asked.

2
00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:11.353
Blinx was shaking and his face was pale.

3
00:00:11.354 --> 00:00:17.452
"The child wants . . . a four-leaf clover," he said.

4
00:00:17.453 --> 00:00:24.702
Sprite laughed. "Are you scared of clovers?"

5
00:00:24.703 --> 00:00:31.188
Blinx huffed. "Of course I'm not scared!

6
00:00:31.189 --> 00:00:35.569
I'm just . . . careful of fairy hunters."

7
00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:37.463
Bumble was worried.

8
00:00:37.464 --> 00:00:41.813
"Can you grant this wish?" he asked.

9
00:00:41.814 --> 00:00:49.533
"Of course I can!" Blinx snapped.

10
00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:51.857
He took the watering can.

11
00:00:51.858 --> 00:00:58.228
He held it far from himself and hurried off.

12
00:00:58.229 --> 00:01:01.247
"See," Feather whispered.

13
00:01:01.248 --> 00:01:09.683
"Blinx doesn't like clovers either!"

14
00:01:09.684 --> 00:01:12.813
Soon Blinx came back.

15
00:01:12.814 --> 00:01:16.404
"Granting this wish will be difficult.

16
00:01:16.405 --> 00:01:20.124
Clovers need to grow in the ground."

17
00:01:20.125 --> 00:01:25.385
Hob shrugged. "We'll plant it outside."

18
00:01:25.386 --> 00:01:28.306
"Sounds good to me," Feather said.

19
00:01:28.307 --> 00:01:34.063
"We can stay out of that scary bedroom!"

20
00:01:34.064 --> 00:01:37.845
"There's one more problem," Blinx said.

21
00:01:37.846 --> 00:01:41.312
"Four-leaf clovers grow among other clovers.

22
00:01:41.313 --> 00:01:45.086
So it won't be easy to find.

23
00:01:45.087 --> 00:01:49.830
People can look for years and never find one." "Years?"

24
00:01:49.831 --> 00:01:52.573
Bumble said. "But

25
00:01:52.574 --> 00:01:55.443
it's Emma's birthday! She

26
00:01:55.444 --> 00:02:01.566
has to find the clover today ."

27
00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:06.250
"We'll just make it easy to find," Sprite said.

28
00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:11.851
"Easy sounds good to me," Hob said.

29
00:02:11.852 --> 00:02:23.053
Blinx's hands shook as he handed over the wishbit.

30
00:02:23.054 --> 00:02:26.793
"Good-bye!"

31
00:02:26.794 --> 00:02:33.543
Soon the fairies landed in a tree in Emma's yard.

32
00:02:33.544 --> 00:02:36.872
Sprite looked around.

33
00:02:36.873 --> 00:02:41.847
"Let's find a good spot to leave the wishbit."

34
00:02:41.848 --> 00:02:48.527
But just then Emma and Maggie came outside.

35
00:02:48.528 --> 00:02:53.094
"Why do you want a four-leaf clover?" Maggie asked.

36
00:02:53.095 --> 00:03:00.230
Emma looked sad. "My family needs some good luck.

37
00:03:00.231 --> 00:03:05.171
Grandpa is sick, and Mom needs a new job."

38
00:03:05.172 --> 00:03:10.235
"I see," Maggie said. "Let's take our bike ride.

39
00:03:10.236 --> 00:03:20.210
Then we can look again in your yard."

40
00:03:20.211 --> 00:03:24.728
Feather gasped as the girls rode off.

41
00:03:24.729 --> 00:03:28.842
"I made a big mistake!" she thought.

42
00:03:28.843 --> 00:03:31.922
"Emma isn't a fairy hunter.

43
00:03:31.923 --> 00:03:41.693
She just needs good luck!"

